1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,025
The Art of Listening.

2
00:00:01,975 --> 00:00:04,987
Most people do not listen to understand.

3
00:00:04,987 --> 00:00:07,037
They listen to reply.

4
00:00:07,037 --> 00:00:13,212
Active listening means giving full attention to the speaker rather than formulating a response while they talk.

5
00:00:13,212 --> 00:00:22,700
It involves three components: paying attention, signaling attentiveness through eye contact and nodding, and responding thoughtfully with questions or brief summaries.

6
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,962
Good listeners make others feel heard and valued.

7
00:00:25,962 --> 00:00:31,112
In a world competing for attention, a genuine listener is rare and powerful.

8
00:00:31,112 --> 00:00:34,962
People remember how others made them feel more than what was said.

